  "notes": "USAGE:\nA compound of {餓|が} (starve, hunger) + {死|し} (death). Used as a suru verb ({餓死|がし}する). A serious and somewhat formal term.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {餓死|がし}する (to starve to death)\n- {餓死者|がししゃ} (people who died of starvation)\n- {餓死|がし}{寸前|すんぜん} (on the verge of starvation)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {飢|う}え: hunger, starvation — the state of being hungry or starving\n- {飢餓|きが}: famine, starvation — a widespread severe shortage of food",
